msgid " I'll be there for you if you ever get caught in a fight nearby."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=3
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T3.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Homeless Man
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "284_Homeless Man"
msgid "By the way, you know about the Dragon Palace?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=3
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T3.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Player
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "296_Player"
msgid "The Dragon Palace? Isn't that some famous castle or something?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=3
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T3.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Homeless Man
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "308_Homeless Man"
msgid "Nah. It's a little hangout spot for us homeless to get together and run some games of chance. Think of it like an arcade, but for grownups!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=3
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T3.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Player
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "320_Player"
msgid "I never heard about it when I was homeless."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=3
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T3.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Homeless Man
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "332_Homeless Man"
msgid "That so? Well, it's the building just west of here. Place was abandoned in the middle of getting built up."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=3
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T3.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Homeless Man
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "344_Homeless Man"
msgid "You're a good guy. I'll tell 'em to let you in. You definitely gotta stop by."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=3
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T3.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Player
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "356_Player"
msgid "I see, thanks for that. I'll check it out sometime."
msgstr ""

